    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Construct is a professionally designed child theme of WENS Haelo, created especially for construction companies, builders, contractors, architects, engineers, and property development businesses. It inherits the powerful features and flexible framework of the WENS Haelo parent theme while adding a dedicated construction-focused design, layout, and content presentation. The theme provides a clean and modern online presence for businesses that want to showcase their construction services, completed projects, company profile, team members, testimonials, and industry expertise. With its professional sections and responsive design, WENS Construct helps construction-related businesses build credibility and attract potential clients."
    },
